[I] POSIX regex lua module base on lrexlib

[T] This module provides POSIX regular exprision matching.
[T] Additionally it is possible to replace the default
[T] string routines to use the POSIX regex syntax.

[U] https://rrthomas.github.io/lrexlib/

[A] Reuben Thomas
[A] Shmuel Zeigerman
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] base/tool
[F] CROSS FPIC

[L] MIT
[V] 9-4

[CV-URL] https://github.com/rrthomas/lrexlib/tags
[D] c643635dccc0f05e6fd77a3d12fda6fc21537cf3c24de098d9f63cb2 lrexlib-9-4.tar.gz https://github.com/rrthomas/lrexlib/archive/rel-2-9-4/

runmake=0

. package/lua/*/lrexlib-conf.in

# inherit lua-pcre, same source base
var_append patchfiles ' ' "`ls $base/package/*/lua-pcre/*.patch 2>/dev/null`"

hook_add inmake 5 "build_lrexlib posix"
